                                "sense_id": "24368e52-d8ea-36dc-ba59-afa474d924fb",
                                "text": "I sat up on the coping of the bridge admiring my frail canvas shoes which I had diligently pipeclayed overnight and watching the docile horses pulling a tramload of business people up the hill."
